OL,3,AThree arrests at rival protests in
OL,4,APortsmouth
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested during
OL,7,Frival protests in Portsmouth, including
OL,8,Fa 76-year-old man suspected of
OL,9,Fconcealing his identity despite a ban
OL,10,Fon face coverings.
OL,12,FPolice were in the city centre as
OL,13,Fanti-migrant protesters assembled and
OL,14,FStand Up To Racism demonstrators
OL,15,Fmarched shortly afterwards.
OL,17,FHampshire Police said on Friday it
OL,18,Fwould use new powers under the Crime
OL,19,Fand Policing Act to prevent protesters
OL,20,Fwearing face coverings that conceal
OL,21,Ftheir identity.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
